  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Welcome to Tricky Treats, we provide consumers with easy to make dog treat and cat treat mixes, gravy, food powder, paw wax, and cat treat mixes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our products are so easy to use, with instructions simple to follow, anyone can do it. Tricky Treats provides products that allow the consumer to make their own dog treats at home without the fuss or worry.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are one of a kind by allowing our customers to have a hand in making their pets a healthy treat without needing to do all the work and research of making sure what they are feeding their pet is good for them, because we've already done that. Our products are all natural, no added sugars or additives. Many ingredients are dehydrated in house and sourced locally. This is a business that thrives on making sure pets are getting the best possible products with lots of research and development. We are growing and adding new products all the time.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Tricky Treats offers a 10% affiliate commission for you to help us spread the word about the treats we love to feed our pets, as well as yours. Cut off for payment will be the last day of each month and payouts will be sent on the first of each month. There is a $10 minimum for payouts, if you have not reached the minimum, your payout will roll over to the next month until you have recieved a minimum of $10, then you will recieve the payout on the 1st of the month.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Thank you for choosing to affiliate with Tricky Treats and helping grow a business that works hard to make sure pets are given the best treats possible.</p>",
